{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through layers\u2014discover ores, dodge traps, fight monsters, and uncover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlast the horrors. Defeat the boss before your energy drains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a weapon strong enough to end the nightmare.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928020/extras/c9cea5744714b580254736503d7f395f.poster.avif?t=1755047586\" width=752 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928020/extras/c9cea5744714b580254736503d7f395f.webm?t=1755047586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928020/extras/c9cea5744714b580254736503d7f395f.mp4?t=1755047586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Version Includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 powerful bosses with distinct styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 monsters with varied forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 usable items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an amateur and novice indie developer, <strong>the demo version inevitably has some balance issues and programming bugs.</strong> This is precisely why I\u2019m releasing the demo early! Please bear with me, adventurers!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Feedback is Crucial!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely hope all adventurers will generously <strong>share your valuable opinions and suggestions during your experience</strong>. Whether it\u2019s bugs you encounter, perceived imbalances, or thoughts on the design of monsters, traps, or items\u2014please let me know!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Goals:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will carefully read and analyze every piece of feedback and use it as a foundation to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize bug fixes and game balance optimizations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously improve existing content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan to add more varieties of monsters, traps, and items in the future!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Don't Blink","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/c773cd7f75db41ddd9e872ec163436a81aa218cb.jpg"},{"name":"Crushed to pieces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/27906b3f70aab40a28f67bc719227a526897da6c.jpg"},{"name":"Moth to the flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/856b248d78b52cee59a8f0f76793326b94ebc986.jpg"},{"name":"Path Unbroken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/5ec024ddb92d05091f2c011bca34011b6356c9b2.jpg"},{"name":"Frog Choir","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/7ebc7ad965a2d10fd3fbdea6dbdf4374c47247bb.jpg"},{"name":"Poisonous Seed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/e76c0c59ea914c6f932d736f8298a7e20f5624b9.jpg"},{"name":"Cut off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/37bedc965d282037bcb96071328973c64ae7927a.jpg"},{"name":"Divine Downfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3928020/fee7677cca3d8ece0d7fd352e8852f413e676915.jpg"},{"name":"Liberation?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap